1236590_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eA0oHnkh9TkQ7kNvwFY19Bf&_nc_oc=AdmH4Yu6AKpmRjvisZvAtIS-dYUUY6VA531bsYEpLk1WJ6ijU41pkY-8rZZuWodRv84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsvCcP52TMic8zUVkhTRsTXP3fvddCeLLLmra8sSIvmxg&oe=69A1A2E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440.png", "id": "1250290243014788", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974750_1250290246348121_2726061545124475027_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tMOW3BeU920Q7kNvwGuuNbj&_nc_oc=AdmEv7xmCZEQGSWMNUW4X0cxcclmg95OUs33vLHDVKHq78pnK_9A6mZWigcpjPYAwn8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuzViblXX5wF1HwDOzU2C2gYojE2sA7gYfM0ZVuQnIx7g&oe=69A19735"}, "display_name": "Side Positioning Assistance Simulator", "keywords": ["CNA", "nurse", "nursing", "training", "simulator"], "long_description": "This Siding Positioning Assistance tutorial trains the essential skill of positioning a patient on their side, focusing on comfort and the prevention of pressure ulcers. The tutorial includes preparation, proper technique for turning and positioning, and ensuring patient safety.  \n\n# Learning Objectives: \n- Remember the steps and protocols for positioning a patient on their side. \n- Understand the importance of proper patient positioning for comfort and pressure ulcer prevention. \n- Apply the correct techniques to position a patient on their side safely. \n- Analyze the patient's condition to determine the best approach for positioning. \n- Evaluate their own technique to ensure it adheres to best practices and safety standards. \n- Create a comfortable and safe environment for patients through proper positioning. \n\nThis comprehensive approach ensures CNAs are well-prepared to assist patients with proper care efficiently and compassionately in real-world clinical settings. ", "short_description": "Master the technique of positioning a patient on their side to ensure comfort and prevent 